---
/** Home intro: one statement, one supporting line, one round button to About. */
---

<section class="section ix" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="container ix-grid">
    <p class="ix-statement" data-reveal>
      Helping Toronto small businesses look professional, get found and follow up. Plain language, a written scope, and
      everything handed over in your name.
    </p>
    <div class="ix-side" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="120">
      <p>
        I’m a small business founder myself. I build websites, set up Google visibility, and connect the tools that make
        sure no enquiry gets missed.
      </p>
      <a class="round-btn" href="/about/" data-magnetic>
        <span class="rb-label" data-magnetic-label>About me</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ix {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 3rem + 7vw, 10rem);
  }
  .ix-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }
  @media (min-width: 56em) {
    .ix-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  .ix-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2.2vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    text-wrap: pretty;
    max-width: 24ch;
  }
  .ix-side {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    justify-items: start;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    max-width: 34ch;
  }
  @media (min-width: 56em) {
    .ix-side {
      padding-top: var(--space-s);
    }
    .ix-side .round-btn {
      margin-top: var(--space-xl);
      margin-left: clamp(0rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    }
  }
</style>
